static int[] slideLeft(int[] row) {
    int n = row.length;
    java.util.List<Integer> tiles = new java.util.ArrayList<>();
    for (int v : row) if (v != 0) tiles.add(v);
    java.util.Collections.sort(tiles);
    for (int i = 0; i < tiles.size() - 1; i++) {
        if (tiles.get(i).equals(tiles.get(i+1))) {
            tiles.set(i, tiles.get(i) * 2);
            tiles.remove(i+1);
        }
    }
    int[] result = new int[n];
    for (int i = 0; i < tiles.size(); i++) result[i] = tiles.get(i);
    return result;
}
```
Description of the change: [LLM] Sort ascending before merge: extract non-zero tiles, sort ascending, merge left-to-right, then pad with zeros.
